{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of <i>Hubert</i>, a loyal shepherd navigating the uncharted northern wilderness. In this atmospheric third-person adventure, guide a scattered flock of sheep across gorgeous nature, braving harsh weather, treacherous terrain, and hidden dangers. <i>Hubert</i>\u00a0blends immersive storytelling with a unique herding gameplay experience, all from the perspective of a devoted working dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/9bc266421f0da51396fc6a3e33a4500f.avif?t=1769615811\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras_big/9bc266421f0da51396fc6a3e33a4500f.avif?t=1769615811 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tale of friendship, bravery, and barking at sheep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Hubert</strong>\u2014fluffy, overconfident dog with a nose for trouble\u2014and his best friend <strong>Lily</strong>, a sharp-witted kid who just convinced the grumpiest farmer in the valley to give them a job. Their mission: herd dozens of mildly chaotic sheep across pastures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well\u2026 not when the sheep have the attention span of a goldfish, the farmer has zero patience, and the nearby forest is lurking with mysterious glowing eyes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc11 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Herding With Heart (and Fur)</strong>: Commander Hubert is leading a battalion of sheeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story Full of Barks and Blunders</strong>: Navigate farm life, forge unlikely friendships, and try to stay on the farmer\u2019s good side (or at least out of range of his angry voice).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's something in the woods?</strong>: Something's out there beyond the fence line. Is it squirrels or something more sinister?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Painted Charm</strong>: Explore a whimsical countryside bursting with cozy vibes, oddball surprises, and the occasional howling at the moon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1769615811\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras_big/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1769615811 width=800 height=587 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains mild mischief, stubborn sheep, and a dog who thinks he\u2019s the main character (He might be right.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/764930?t=1769615811","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/663685ff0cd9429c05a9966c5bb5f3a4db8bddc4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769615811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/1100d6875a29de3d10f83ff2aa1e28843c8268cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769615811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/1100d6875a29de3d10f83ff2aa1e28843c8268cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769615811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of <i>Hubert</i>, a loyal shepherd navigating the uncharted northern wilderness. In this